# 💬 CODTECH Internship – Task 2  
## Real-Time Chat Application

This project is developed as part of the **CODTECH Internship Program – Task 2**.  
The objective of this task is to build a **real-time chat application** using **WebSocket / Socket.IO** with proper **frontend and backend integration**.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The Real-Time Chat Application allows multiple users to:
- Join a chat room
- Send and receive messages instantly
- Experience real-time communication using WebSockets

---

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

### Frontend
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

### Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- Socket.IO

---

## ✨ Features

- 🔴 Real-time messaging
- 👥 Multiple users support
- 🔄 Instant message updates without page refresh
- 📡 WebSocket-based communication
- 🔗 Frontend & Backend integration

---

## 📂 Project Structure📸 Output
Users can send messages
Messages appear instantly for all connected users
Real-time communication achieved using Socket.IO
🎯 Internship Task Requirement Fulfilled
✅ Developed a real-time chat application
✅ Used WebSocket / Socket.IO
✅ Implemented frontend & backend integration
✅ Live chat functionality working successfully
